= Meeting with the Confederation of Private Business Associations

García meets privately with industrial leaders and foreign diplomats, promising fiscal restraint and open communication. The markets stabilize slightly, though left-wing APRA factions grumble about compromise.

- @election_night: Fast forward to Election Night (April 14)
